Attribution for scientific content
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Force-field parameters are facts rather than copyrightable expression, so no
licence restriction attaches to them. The original work should be cited:

  - MINFF: https://github.com/mholmboe/minff
  - CLAYFF: Cygan, Liang and Kalinichev, J. Phys. Chem. B 2004, 108, 1255-1266.
  - Ion parameters: Joung and Cheatham (2008), Aqvist (1990), Babu and Lim
    (2006), and Li, Song, Merz and co-workers (2015-2021), as listed in the
    header of atomipy/ffparams/min.ff/ions.itp.
  - Oxygen charge smearing: Lammers et al. (2017),
    doi:10.1016/j.jcis.2016.11.084.
  - Water model parameters: the respective original publications.
  - Crystal structures: the crystallographic studies cited where those
    structures are documented.
